hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1777","Umm al-Mu’minin Aisha Siddiqa (may Allah be pleased with her) says: I never saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) laugh so hard that his throat became visible; rather, he (peace and blessings be upon him) would only smile.... The rest of the hadith has already been mentioned in the Book of the Beginning of Creation."
